<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Mykonos — 24–29 Haziran 2025</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,300;1,400&family=Jost:wght@200;300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --sand: #EDF4FA;
    --warm-white: #F8FBFF;
    --stone: #A2BFCF;
    --terracotta: #1C6FA8;
    --deep-terra: #124E7A;
    --aegean: #1A5F94;
    --aegean-light: #4A9CC8;
    --ink: #0B1F2E;
    --muted: #4A7A96;
    --gold: #2980B9;
    --divider: #C0D8EA;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    background: var(--sand);
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 300;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  .page {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 60px 40px 80px;
  }

  /* ── HEADER ── */
  .header {
    text-align: center;
    padding-bottom: 48px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
    margin-bottom: 56px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .header-label {
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 200;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .header h1 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 64px;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .header h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--terracotta);
  }

  .header-dates {
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 200;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .header-sub {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  /* ── FLIGHT STRIP ── */
  .flight-strip {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .flight-card {
    flex: 1;
    background: var(--warm-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--divider);
    padding: 20px 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .flight-icon {
    font-size: 20px;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .flight-info {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .flight-direction {
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .flight-route {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .flight-details {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 3px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  /* ── DAY CARD ── */
  .day-card {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .day-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 72px 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    align-items: start;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .day-number {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 72px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 0.85;
    color: var(--divider);
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .day-info {
    padding-left: 16px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--terracotta);
    margin-left: 0;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .day-date {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .day-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .day-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--aegean); }

  .day-tagline {
    font-style: italic;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* ── BLOCKS ── */
  .blocks {
    padding-left: 88px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .block {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    background: var(--warm-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--divider);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .block.evening {
    background: var(--warm-white);
    border-color: var(--divider);
  }

  .block.wedding {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0A2A45 0%, #051828 100%);
    border-color: #4A9CC8;
    padding: 20px 24px;
  }

  .block.wedding .block-time { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }
  .block.wedding .block-label { color: var(--gold); }
  .block.wedding .block-venue { color: #C8E8F8; font-size: 20px; }
  .block.wedding .block-desc { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }
  .block.wedding .block-note { color: var(--gold); opacity: 0.7; }

  .block-time {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 400;
    padding-top: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .block-content {}

  .block-label {
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }

  .block-venue {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .block-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 4px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .block-note {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--stone);
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }

  .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    background: var(--sand);
    border: 1px solid var(--divider);
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 6px;
    margin-right: 4px;
  }

  .block.evening .tag {
    background: var(--sand);
    border-color: var(--divider);
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* style badge */
  .style-note {
    padding-left: 88px;
    margin-top: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .style-note-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);
    background: rgba(184,150,106,0.06);
  }

  .style-note-label {
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 400;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .style-note-text {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ── DIVIDER ── */
  .day-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--divider);
    margin: 44px 0;
  }

  /* ── SUMMARY TABLE ── */
  .summary-section {
    margin-top: 60px;
    padding-top: 48px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .summary-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--divider);
    background: var(--warm-white);
  }

  .summary-row {
    display: contents;
  }

  .summary-row > div {
    padding: 14px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .summary-row:last-child > div {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .summary-day-col {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 400;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--divider);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .summary-day-col span {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .summary-plan-col {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .summary-plan-col strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  /* ── RESERVATIONS ── */
  .reservations {
    margin-top: 48px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .res-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--divider);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    background: var(--warm-white);
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .res-priority {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--divider);
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 28px;
  }

  .res-name {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .res-note {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  .footer {
    margin-top: 60px;
    padding-top: 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .footer-left {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .footer-right {
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--stone);
  }

  /* ── WEDDING BADGE ── */
  .wedding-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    background: #4A9CC8;
    color: white;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  /* ── MOBILE ── */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .page {
      padding: 36px 20px 60px;
    }

    .header h1 {
      font-size: 48px;
    }

    .header-sub {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .flight-strip {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .flight-card {
      padding: 16px 18px;
    }

    .day-header {
      grid-template-columns: 52px 1fr;
    }

    .day-number {
      font-size: 52px;
    }

    .day-title {
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .blocks {
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .block {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
    }

    .block-time {
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: var(--terracotta);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
      padding-bottom: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .block.evening .block-time {
      color: var(--gold);
      border-bottom-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }

    .block.wedding .block-time {
      border-bottom-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    }

    .block-venue {
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .block-desc {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .style-note {
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .style-note-inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .summary-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .summary-row > div {
      border-right: none !important;
      padding: 12px 16px;
    }

    .summary-day-col {
      border-bottom: none !important;
      padding-bottom: 2px !important;
      background: var(--sand);
    }

    .summary-plan-col {
      padding-top: 4px !important;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider) !important;
    }

    .reservations {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .footer {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-left {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .day-divider {
      margin: 32px 0;
    }
  }

  /* optional: soft horizon decoration */
  .horizon {
    width: 100%;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #4A9CC8 30%, #1C6FA8 60%, #A8D8F0 80%, transparent);
    opacity: 0.35;
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-label">Seyahat Planı</div>
    <h1><em>Mykonos</em></h1>
    <div class="horizon"></div>
    <div class="header-dates">24 — 29 Haziran 2025</div>
    <div class="header-sub">Casa Del Mar · Düğün: Santa Marina Hotel, 26 Haziran</div>
  </div>

  <!-- FLIGHTS -->
  <div class="flight-strip">
    <div class="flight-card">
      <div class="flight-icon">↗</div>
      <div class="flight-info">
        <div class="flight-direction">Gidiş</div>
        <div class="flight-route">İstanbul → Mykonos</div>
        <div class="flight-details">24 Haziran Çarşamba · 08:25 – 09:45 · Aegean Airlines, direkt</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flight-card">
      <div class="flight-icon">↙</div>
      <div class="flight-info">
        <div class="flight-direction">Dönüş</div>
        <div class="flight-route">Mykonos → İstanbul</div>
        <div class="flight-details">29 Haziran Pazartesi · 10:15 – 11:35 · Aegean Airlines, direkt</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- DAY 1 -->
  <div class="day-card">
    <div class="day-header">
      <div class="day-number">01</div>
      <div class="day-info">
        <div class="day-date">24 Haziran Çarşamba</div>
        <div class="day-title">Varış & <em>Soft Başlangıç</em></div>
        <div class="day-tagline">Adaya merhaba</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="blocks">
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-time">10:30 – 16:30</div>
        <div class="block-content">
          <div class="block-label">Konaklama</div>
          <div class="block-venue">Casa Del Mar — Private Cove</div>
          <div class="block-desc">Yerleşme, dinlenme, otelin sakin private beach tarafı. Uçuş sonrası güne yumuşak giriş.</div>
          <span class="tag">Pool</span><span class="tag">Deniz</span><span class="tag">Dinlenme</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-time">18:30 – 20:00</div>
        <div class="block-content">
          <div class="block-label">Şehir</div>
          <div class="block-venue">Mykonos Town — Little Venice</div>
          <div class="block-desc">Kısa yürüyüş, butiklere bakma, ara sokaklar. Adaya alışma turu.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block evening">
        <div class="block-time">20:30</div>
        <div class="block-content">
          <div class="block-label">Akşam Yemeği</div>
          <div class="block-venue">Branco Mykonos</div>
          <div class="block-desc">Platis Gialos Beach'te. Beach, hotel ve wellness konseptli, yumuşak ve şık başlangıç noktası.</div>
          <div class="block-note">Bu gece erken dönelim — 25 ve 26 daha önemli.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="style-note">
      <div class="style-note-inner">
        <span class="style-note-label">Stil</span>
        <span class="style-note-text">Keten elbise, gold aksesuar, düz sandalet — fresh island elegance</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="day-divider"></div>

  <!-- DAY 2 -->
  <div class="day-card">
    <div class="day-header">
      <div class="day-number">02</div>
      <div class="day-info">
        <div class="day-date">25 Haziran Perşembe</div>
        <div class="day-title"><em>Elegant Beach</em> + İyi Akşam</div>
        <div class="day-tagline">Düğünden önceki en güzel tam gün</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="blocks">
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-time">09:30 – 11:00</div>
        <div class="block-content">
          <div class="block-label">Kahvaltı</div>
          <div class="block-venue">Miramar Restaurant — Casa Del Mar</div>
          <div class="block-desc">Denize bakan terastan à la carte kahvaltı. Cycladic çiftliklerden incir ve yoğurt, ballı Greek scramble, taze ekmekler, soğuk kesimler. 08:00–12:30 arası servis. İstersen villa terasına da getirtebilirsin.</div>
          <span class="tag">08:00–12:30</span><span class="tag">Terasa Servis Mümkün</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-time">12:30 – 17:00</div>
        <div class="block-content">
          <div class="block-label">Beach Club</div>
          <div class="block-venue">Principote — Panormos Beach</div>
          <div class="block-desc">Elegant, polished, kaliteli servis. Mediterranean cuisine, lüks ama aşırı party değil. Discreet service konsepti. Beach bed + lunch birlikte rezervasyon — 14:00 öğle için ideal.</div>
          <span class="tag">★ Ana Seçim</span><span class="tag">Rezervasyon Gerekli</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block evening">
        <div class="block-time">20:30 / 21:00</div>
        <div class="block-content">
          <div class="block-label">Akşam Yemeği</div>
          <div class="block-venue">Nōema Mykonos</div>
          <div class="block-desc">Mykonos Town, hidden courtyard. Modern Greek restaurant & bar, Cycladic kültür ve müzik havası. Düğünden önceki gece için mükemmel: kaliteli ama çok club gibi yorucu değil.</div>
          <div class="block-note">22:30 sonrası isteğe bağlı içki — ama çok geçe kalmayalım.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="style-note">
      <div class="style-note-inner">
        <span class="style-note-label">Principote</span>
        <span class="style-note-text">Kaftan, elegant cover-up, hasır çanta</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="style-note" style="margin-top:6px;">
      <div class="style-note-inner">
        <span class="style-note-label">Nōema</span>
        <span class="style-note-text">Nude / amphora / champagne — sade ama iddialı</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="day-divider"></div>

  <!-- DAY 3 — WEDDING -->
  <div class="day-card">
    <div class="day-header">
      <div class="day-number">03</div>
      <div class="day-info">
        <div class="day-date">26 Haziran Cuma</div>
        <div class="day-title">Düğün Günü — <em>Santa Marina</em></div>
        <div class="day-tagline">Ana kural: yorulmak yok</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="blocks">
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-time">09:30 – 14:00</div>
        <div class="block-content">
          <div class="block-label">Sabah</div>
          <div class="block-venue">Casa Del Mar — Sakin Deniz & Hafif Öğle</div>
          <div class="block-desc">Başka beach club yok. Güneş, tuz, saç, makyaj ve transfer stresi yaratmayalım. Hafif öğle: salata, grilled fish, meze tarzı. Şişkinlik yapmayacak seçimler.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block">
        <div class="block-time">15:00 – 17:30</div>
        <div class="block-content">
          <div class="block-label">Hazırlık</div>
          <div class="block-venue">Saç · Makyaj · Dinlenme</div>
          <div class="block-desc">Transfer Casa Del Mar → Santa Marina için özel araç. En az 30–40 dk buffer. Mykonos trafiği ve dar yollar stres yaratabilir.</div>
          <span class="tag">Transfer Rezervasyonu Gerekli</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="block wedding">
        <div class="block-time">Akşam</div>
        <div class="block-content">
          <div class="block-label">★ Düğün</div>
          <div class="block-venue">Santa Marina Hotel</div>
          <div class="block-desc">Amphora, soft blush, nude rose, champagne, pale terracotta, flowing fabric. Çok beyaz değil, gelin rengine yaklaşmadan. Akışkan kumaş, iyi kesim, sade altın takı.</div>
          <div class="block-note">Ayakkabı mutlaka rahat — Santa Marina'da yürüyüş olabilir.</div>
          <div><span class="wedding-badge">Öncelikli Rezervasyon: Transfer</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="day-divider"></div>

  <!-- DAY 4 -->
  <div class="day-card">
    <div class="day-header">
      <div class="day-number">04</div>
      <div class="day-info">
        <div class="day-date">27 Haziran Cumartesi</div>
        <div class="day-title">Recovery & <em>Scorpios Sunset</em></div>
        <div class="day-tagline">Enerjiye göre esnek gün</div>
